    "en": {
      "trackName": "PrismFlow Block Puzzle",
      "description": "Flow the colors, free your mind.\n\nPrismFlow Block Puzzle is a calm, colorful block puzzle you can play in short sessions or long streaks. Drag pieces onto the board, fill rows and columns, and watch them clear — simple rules, deep scoring.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n• Three block shapes appear in the tray — drag each one onto the 8×8 board\n• Complete full rows or columns to clear them and earn points\n• Chain clears to build combos and push your score higher\n• Game over when none of the three pieces fit — can you beat your best?\n\nFEATURES\n• Smooth drag-and-drop controls tuned for one-hand play\n• Glossy blocks, satisfying clears, and combo feedback\n• Global leaderboard — compete with players worldwide\n• Daily streak reminders (optional)\n• Multiple languages\n• Play offline anytime; sign in for cloud sync and leaderboard\n\nFREE TO PLAY\nPrismFlow is free with optional ads. You can remove ads or buy continue tokens via in-app purchase. No account required to play.\n\nDownload now and find your flow.",
      "releaseNotes": "- More informative displays have been developed for the in-game store and main screen.\n- Performance improvements and display enhancements have been implemented.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/prismflow-block-puzzle/id6784841022?uo=4",
